euse, Sax's birthplace, dramatic riverside setting","body":"Dinant is a relatively small but very picturesque city in the province of Namur in Belgium. It stretches along the river Meuse against the steep rock face behind on the eastern side, with a thinner strip on the western side against a forest. Its old town is perhaps one of the most impressive sights in Wallonia, but the locality is relatively remote. The main sights are all close to each other and not very numerous, while accommodation opportunities are scarce, so Dinant is probably a good option for a nice day trip from larger Belgian cities such as Brussels, Charleroi or Liège. It also can serve as the starting point for a more thorough exploration of the Ardennes.","grounding":[{"source":"wikivoyage","title":"Dinant","url":"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Dinant","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"short":"Dinant is a town in Belgium set along the River Meuse. Rocher Bayard and the Abbaye Notre-Dame de Leffe take up about six hours, with Castle of Veves further out among the hills. Transport is poor, so plan for May through September.","short_src":"rewrite","facts":{"population":12875,"visit_h":4.3}},"highlights":[{"id":"hl-citadel-of-dinant","name":"Citadel of Dinant","kind":"Museum","lat":50.2617,"lon":4.91339,"dist_km":0.2,"rank_score":7.45,"resolved_by":"catalogue","image":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/07/0_Dinant_-_La_citadelle_%281%29.JPG/960px-0_Dinant_-_La_citadelle_%281%29.JPG","author":"Jean-Pol GRANDMONT","licence":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licence_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:0_Dinant_-_La_citadelle_(1).JPG","ok_print":true}},{"id":"hl-spontin-castle","name":"Spontin Castle","kind":"Castle","lat":50.32222,"lon":5.00778,"dist_km":9.7,"rank_score":6.37,"resolved_by":"catalogue"},{"id":"hl-naulette","name":"Naulette","kind":"Cave","lat":50.214,"lon":4.931,"dist_km":5.4,"rank_score":6.24,"resolved_by":"catalogue